Tectonic v{version}

  1) namesakes/apps/client  An app client with a namesake (requires flatpak)
  2) namesakes/desktop/client  A desktop client with a namesake (requires flatpak)
  3) namesakes/flatpak  The provider for both namesake clients
Which modules? [1-3, several, 0 for none]: 1 2

List it in example? (Yes/No)
Yes

The selected modules have dependencies not currently provided by the images:

  apps/client > fedora-bootc:44
    requires: flatpak
    provider module: flatpak

  desktop/client > fedora-bootc:44
    requires: flatpak
    provider module: flatpak

Add these provider modules now? (Yes/No)
Yes


